# Playwright. `e2e/.seed.json` holds a device token issued by the seeder for the
# throwaway e2e database — regenerated on every run, and never a secret worth
# keeping, but there is no reason for a credential to be in git at all.
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/
/e2e/.seed.json

